      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُلُفٌ</span></b>  A she-camel (Ibn-'Abbád, K) <i>that rises</i>
[<i>app. with difficulty</i> (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَالِفٌ</span>)] <i>with her load.</i>
(T, Ibn-'Abbád, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  It is also a pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَالِفٌ</span>:
(K:) and of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَلُوفٌ</span>. (TA.)

